@Public = http://localhost:8080
@Internal = http://localhost:8081

POST {{Internal}}/healthz/live
Accept: application/json

### Create or retry business incident
POST {{Internal}}/events
Content-Type: application/json; charset=utf-8

{
  "specversion": "1.0",
  "type": "io.intropy.business_incident.triggered",
  "source": "urn:maxbo:customers-mdc-extractors-fno",
  "subject": "123",
  "id": "lk234klj234jkl234",
  "time": "2026-03-24T00:00:00.001Z",
  "datacontenttype": "application/json",
  "batchid": "1",
  "data": {
    "description": "Failed to validate invoice",
    "context": {
      "invoiceId": "8923749",
      "errorMessage": "The field 'recipient' has no value"
    }
  }
}

### List business incidents
GET {{Public}}/incidents#?status=open
Accept: application/json


### Get business incident
GET {{Public}}/incidents/15e195c6-c1a4-41c7-8f50-306be0db86ce
Accept: application/json


### Resolve business incident
POST {{Internal}}/events
Content-Type: application/json; charset=utf-8

{
  "specversion": "1.0",
  "type": "io.intropy.business_incident.resolved",
  "source": "urn:maxbo:customers-mdc-extractors-fno",
  "subject": "123",
  "id": "lk234klj234jkl234",
  "time": "2026-03-24T01:00:00.001Z",
  "datacontenttype": "application/json",
  "batchid": "1"
}



### Get business incident events
GET {{Public}}/incidents/15e195c6-c1a4-41c7-8f50-306be0db86ce/events
Accept: application/json
